sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Researcher
    participant GO as Go Edge API
    participant DC as Python DiscoveryController
    participant AR as Discovery Archive
    participant GEN as Selected Generator
    participant EX as Experiment/Admission
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Queue
    participant W as Python Worker
    participant EV as Evaluator

    U->>GO: POST /search-runs {generator_id: discovery}
    GO->>DC: signed command + principal/quota
    DC->>AR: freeze split, policies and initial stats

    loop one active candidate, stop check before admission
        DC->>DC: select runnable generator
        DC->>GEN: propose CandidateSpec + lineage
        GEN-->>DC: candidate or recorded provider failure
        DC->>AR: canonical hash + duplicate/parent checks
        alt new candidate admitted
            DC->>EX: reserve four backtests and create train snapshot
            EX->>DB: immutable train experiment + job
            W->>DB: claim with lease and run train
            W->>EV: BacktestCompleted via outbox
            EV->>AR: train metrics
            alt cheap gate passes
                DC->>EX: admit V1, V2, V3 snapshots
                EX->>DB: three immutable validation jobs
                W->>EV: execute/evaluate each window
                EV->>AR: validation metrics + aligned returns
                DC->>AR: assess score, correlation, accept/reject
            else train rejected
                DC->>AR: cheap rejection with no validation jobs
            end
        else duplicate or invalid
            DC->>AR: terminal skip or failure with no experiment
        end
    end

    opt normal completion and accepted survivor
        DC->>EX: exactly one sealed test for best candidate
        EX->>DB: immutable test experiment + job
        W->>EV: execute/evaluate and persist separately
        EV->>AR: final test completed outside score and parent updates
    end

    Note over DC,AR: Test data never reaches generation, acceptance,<br/>parent selection or generator adaptation.
